providing high availability

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:32.540
and low latency for the users.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:36.170
Foo.com might have some
media processing functions

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:39.380
for processing images
and video files.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:42.440
It can be deployed on
Cloud Functions, which

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:46.700
is a serverless function as a
service that scales as needed

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:50.180
and can be triggered
via HTTP, Cloud

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:52.250
Storage, and other services.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.740
For asynchronous
messaging services,

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:57.890
we will use hubsub, send
messages to a topic.

00:07:57.890 --> 00:08:00.500
And servers could
